@Fridge003 @BBuf could you review this sampling regression coverage and authorize `run-ci`? Tagging you based on your recent sampling reviews in #38565 and #47512.

At `b00f19281b18`, the exact PR test file passed all 4 tests with no skips on an NVIDIA L40S (SM89), PyTorch 2.14.1+cu130 / CUDA 13.0. This covers bit-exact hash block boundaries and UINT32_MAX, plus seeded sampling replay, split-batch, single-row and permutation invariance.

I have updated the validation section and marked this ready for review. The earlier upstream runs were blocked by draft status; the local GPU run is not a claim that upstream CI passed.

